ok a quoted string reads without its quotes
ok an integer reads as Integer
ok a plain string reads as written
ok a nested integer reads
ok a boolean reads
ok a # inside quotes is not a comment
ok key? sees leaves only
ok a list is refused with its line
ok an anchor is refused
ok a block scalar is refused
ok a flow collection is refused
ok a single-quoted string is refused
ok a tab in the indentation is refused
ok a duplicate key is refused
ok a map key without children is refused
ok a map key at the end of the file is refused
ok an indented line under a scalar is refused
ok an unterminated quote is refused
ok a line without a key is refused
ok a missing space after the colon is refused
ok a non-integer read as int names the key
ok a quoted number is a string, not an int
ok a non-boolean read as bool names the key
ok a missing key names the key
ok load of a missing file names the path
ok KILAU_SERVER_PORT overrides server.port
